<title>USA: U.S. ambassador not among hostages in Peru.</title>
<headline>U.S. ambassador not among hostages in Peru.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. ambassador to Peru Dennis Jett was not in the Japanese ambassador's residence in Lima when it was stormed by armed guerrillas, a State Department official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We do not know if there are any other American diplomats in the building, but I can assure you that the U.S. ambassador is not there,&quot; the official said.</p>
</text>
